{"id":"detalle","lemma":"detalle","pos":"noun","rank":1094,"glosses":["detail","nice gesture, beau geste, attention","small gift"],"ipa":"/deˈtaʝe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"detalles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-detalle.wav","examples":[{"text":"Conozco todos los detalles.","en":"I know all the details.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461959","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"¿Lo podrías explicar con más detalle?","en":"Would you explain it in more detail?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531671","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to explain"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Él me dio todos los detalles.","en":"He told me all the details.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639144","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"No sé los detalles.","en":"I don't know the details.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585861","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Ése fue un detalle bonito.","en":"That was a nice touch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301994","words":[{"g":"that one"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"pretty, cute"}]}]}